\b Esco EV OBD Scanner\b0\par
Read-only diagnostics for electric cars.\par\par
\b Safety\b0\par
The program only sends read-only diagnostic requests. It never writes to the car, clears fault codes or unlocks security access. Long sessions keep the car awake: keep it in READY or on charge, and unplug the adapter when you are done.\par\par
The app includes the .NET runtime and PDFsharp/MigraDoc, both MIT licensed; their notices are in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the installation folder.\par\par
